---
title: SEQ-06 — Teacher dashboard and access (UC-18)
config:
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Teacher as Teacher
    participant App as Itqan App
    participant Class as Class Service
    participant DB as Database
    Teacher->>App: Open dashboard
    App->>Class: Get Teacher's Classes
    Class->>DB: Read Classes owned by Teacher
    alt No Classes
        DB-->>Class: Empty
        Class-->>App: No Classes
        App-->>Teacher: Prompt Create Class (UC-17)
    else Classes exist
        DB-->>Class: Owned Classes
        Class-->>App: Class list
        Teacher->>App: Select Class
        App->>Class: Get Class dashboard
        Class->>DB: Verify Teacher owns Class and list active Readers
        alt No active Readers
            DB-->>Class: No active Enrolments
            Class-->>App: Empty Class with join code
            App-->>Teacher: Show join code
        else Active Readers
            DB-->>Class: Active Readers and enrolment dates
            Class->>DB: Derive activity, full mastery and average from visible Sessions
            Note over Class,DB: Only Sessions ended on or after earliest active join date across this Teacher's Classes
            DB-->>Class: Filtered Reader summaries
            Class-->>App: Activity, completion and average per Reader
            App-->>Teacher: Show Class view
            Teacher->>App: Select Reader
            App->>Class: getVisibleSessions(Teacher, Class, Reader)
            Class->>DB: Recheck Class ownership and active enrolment
            alt Reader left or withdrew consent
                DB-->>Class: No active access
                Class-->>App: Deny Reader drill-down
                App-->>Teacher: Return to Class view
            else Access still active
                DB-->>Class: Earliest active join date for this Teacher and Reader
                Class->>DB: Read Sessions ended on or after join date
                DB-->>Class: Visible Surah, date, mode and score
                Class-->>App: Reader Session list
                alt No visible Sessions
                    App-->>Teacher: Empty Session list
                else Sessions exist
                    App-->>Teacher: Show Reader Sessions
                    Teacher->>App: Select Session
                    App->>Class: getVisibleSessions(Teacher, Class, Reader, Session)
                    Class->>DB: Recheck active access and Session end date
                    alt Access no longer valid
                        DB-->>Class: Denied
                        Class-->>App: Denied
                        App-->>Teacher: Do not show Session
                    else Access valid
                        DB-->>Class: Permitted Session
                        Class->>DB: Read Mistakes with Word and Tajweed Rule
                        DB-->>Class: Word, error type and Rule
                        Class-->>App: Permitted mistake details
                        App-->>Teacher: Show Session view without audio
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
